[
  {
    "start": 14.0,
    "end": 14.654,
    "text": "Welcome."
  },
  {
    "start": 21.154,
    "end": 22.677,
    "text": "It's Sunday evening."
  },
  {
    "start": 25.077,
    "end": 27.167,
    "text": "And the week hasn't started yet."
  },
  {
    "start": 33.667,
    "end": 35.309,
    "text": "Let your eyes close."
  },
  {
    "start": 37.709,
    "end": 40.463,
    "text": "And take one long, slow breath in."
  },
  {
    "start": 44.063,
    "end": 45.967,
    "text": "And a soft breath out."
  },
  {
    "start": 55.967,
    "end": 57.825,
    "text": "Maybe you can feel it already."
  },
  {
    "start": 60.225,
    "end": 62.64,
    "text": "Monday, arriving early."
  },
  {
    "start": 65.04,
    "end": 66.938,
    "text": "Did I reply to that email?"
  },
  {
    "start": 69.338,
    "end": 73.061,
    "text": "The things you keep forgetting and then remembering."
  },
  {
    "start": 79.561,
    "end": 81.79,
    "text": "Notice where it sits in your body."
  },
  {
    "start": 91.79,
    "end": 93.323,
    "text": "Maybe your chest."
  },
  {
    "start": 95.723,
    "end": 97.348,
    "text": "Maybe your shoulders."
  },
  {
    "start": 107.348,
    "end": 109.577,
    "text": "Thinking is what minds do."
  },
  {
    "start": 116.077,
    "end": 118.074,
    "text": "Now let's do something practical."
  },
  {
    "start": 120.474,
    "end": 123.725,
    "text": "Let every unfinished thing in your mind surface."
  },
  {
    "start": 126.125,
    "end": 128.261,
    "text": "Every task, worry,"
  },
  {
    "start": 130.661,
    "end": 133.122,
    "text": "obligation, half-formed plan."
  },
  {
    "start": 135.522,
    "end": 137.008,
    "text": "The big things."
  },
  {
    "start": 139.408,
    "end": 140.848,
    "text": "The small things."
  },
  {
    "start": 143.248,
    "end": 144.617,
    "text": "Welcome all of it."
  },
  {
    "start": 154.617,
    "end": 157.775,
    "text": "You're letting the mind empty onto the table"
  },
  {
    "start": 160.175,
    "end": 163.101,
    "text": "so it can stop cycling through the same list."
  },
  {
    "start": 173.101,
    "end": 175.562,
    "text": "As each one arrives, notice it."
  },
  {
    "start": 177.962,
    "end": 180.651,
    "text": "A single word, like a tag."
  },
  {
    "start": 183.051,
    "end": 184.073,
    "text": "Planning."
  },
  {
    "start": 186.473,
    "end": 187.541,
    "text": "Worrying."
  },
  {
    "start": 189.941,
    "end": 191.476,
    "text": "And then let it pass."
  },
  {
    "start": 201.476,
    "end": 202.962,
    "text": "Now take a breath."
  },
  {
    "start": 206.562,
    "end": 208.652,
    "text": "All of those things are real."
  },
  {
    "start": 211.052,
    "end": 212.77,
    "text": "They deserve attention,"
  },
  {
    "start": 215.17,
    "end": 217.864,
    "text": "and that attention has its own time."
  },
  {
    "start": 224.364,
    "end": 226.222,
    "text": "Right now, you are here."
  },
  {
    "start": 228.622,
    "end": 229.876,
    "text": "Doing this."
  },
  {
    "start": 232.276,
    "end": 233.623,
    "text": "And that is enough."
  },
  {
    "start": 240.123,
    "end": 242.677,
    "text": "You're choosing, for these minutes,"
  },
  {
    "start": 245.077,
    "end": 246.656,
    "text": "to set the weight down."
  },
  {
    "start": 256.656,
    "end": 259.024,
    "text": "Bring your attention to your chest."
  },
  {
    "start": 261.424,
    "end": 263.142,
    "text": "A warmth spreading there."
  },
  {
    "start": 265.542,
    "end": 266.657,
    "text": "An opening."
  },
  {
    "start": 276.657,
    "end": 278.607,
    "text": "Anything you've been holding in,"
  },
  {
    "start": 281.007,
    "end": 283.004,
    "text": "it's safe to let it go now."
  },
  {
    "start": 289.504,
    "end": 291.129,
    "text": "Come back to the breath."
  },
  {
    "start": 293.529,
    "end": 296.219,
    "text": "If something tries to pull you back in,"
  },
  {
    "start": 298.619,
    "end": 301.591,
    "text": "acknowledge, release, return."
  },
  {
    "start": 311.591,
    "end": 313.495,
    "text": "You know how to do this now."
  },
  {
    "start": 319.995,
    "end": 321.945,
    "text": "The breath is always here."
  },
  {
    "start": 324.345,
    "end": 326.435,
    "text": "It is infinitely patient."
  },
  {
    "start": 336.435,
    "end": 337.41,
    "text": "Stay here."
  },
  {
    "start": 339.81,
    "end": 341.482,
    "text": "Resting in clarity."
  },
  {
    "start": 351.482,
    "end": 352.922,
    "text": "Monday will come."
  },
  {
    "start": 355.322,
    "end": 356.994,
    "text": "Tonight is still tonight."
  },
  {
    "start": 363.494,
    "end": 365.305,
    "text": "Let the focus soften."
  },
  {
    "start": 367.705,
    "end": 369.377,
    "text": "One deep breath in."
  },
  {
    "start": 372.977,
    "end": 374.045,
    "text": "And out."
  },
  {
    "start": 384.045,
    "end": 386.646,
    "text": "When you're ready, open your eyes."
  },
  {
    "start": 393.146,
    "end": 394.771,
    "text": "Thank you for being here."
  }
]
